  math.prose.precision,16,null,documented,"IEEE754 double-precision support is a scope statement, not an executable filter."
  math.prose.one-input-arity,18,manual.math.sin,covered,The sin() notation is covered by the zero-argument jq witness for the one-input signature.
  math.prose.two-input-arity,18,manual.math.pow,covered,The pow() notation is covered by the two-argument jq witness for the two-input signature.
  math.prose.three-input-arity,18,manual.math.fma,covered,The three-input arity rule is covered by the fma witness.
